  "label": "antisemitic stereotype mapped onto roasted turkey",
  "description": "The text 'little foil on top keeps them jewsy' is an antisemitic stereotype that is explicitly mapped onto the visual entity 'roasted_turkey'. The meme uses the visual of the turkey (a common holiday food) to represent or symbolize the stereotype, which falsely implies Jewish people are controlled or 'kept' by the foil used in cooking the turkey. This is a direct analogical mapping where the textual stereotype is projected onto the visual food item.",
